&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always on the lookout for new talent. Whether you&#39;re looking to kick-start your campaign management career, are a hands-on CRM specialist, or a seasoned Marketing Manager with campaign strategy and leadership experience, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our embedded inhouse model, you will be employed by DEPT® but embedded within our Client’s team. From your day-to-day responsibilities, collaborations and deliverables, you’ll operate directly within the client team, allowing for the best of both worlds: the close-knit feel and impact of working inhouse, alongside access to the benefits, opportunities and support that DEPT® offers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bridge the gap between marketing strategy, end-to-end multichannel campaign delivery, and AI innovation. Sitting at the intersection of campaign strategy, CRM execution, marketing technology, and creative production, you will be responsible for how the client presents itself to customers across owned channels (email, push, onsite, in-app, landing pages). Depending on your level, you will manage campaign plans, build and QA CRM workflows, optimise cross-channel engagement, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to scale personalisation and elevate performance.&lt;/p&gt;
